      <activity id="6a0ce6bf-204c-53b5-ad2c-1df530a23094" activityNameId="f08e66df-4ab1-5670-b3ab-6469f388f652" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Manual treatment plant, WEEE scrap</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Manual treatment plant, WEEE scrap
The functional unit represents a site for the manual treatment of WEEE devices. Process data based on own estimations, using proper experiences within the Swiss e-Waste systems. The here described manual treatment site has an assumed treatment capacity of 2’500 t per year over a time span of 25 years.;
UUID: e09e23d9-b02d-3840-8c4a-797fbb0529b3
This module includes land use and buildings as well as the respective disposal activities of a plant for manual WEEE treatment.
Location: This module is based on experiences in Switzerland as a proxy for the global situation. 
Technology: Manual treatment plant, based on proper knowledge about companies in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e09e23d9-b02d-3840-8c4a-797fbb0529b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
